    <div class="docs-card" style="border-left-color: var(--color-accent-green);">
        <h2 class="docs-title">5. Su Anki Yaklasim (Loop34) — Binance-Polymarket Arbitrage</h2>
        <p class="docs-source">Kaynak: Benjamin-Cup (Medium, Subat 2026) + Black-Scholes / Brownian motion</p>

        <p>
            Akademik yayinlanmis arbitraj formulu. <strong>Tahmin yapmiyoruz</strong> — Binance spot fiyatini Brownian motion
            (rastgele yuruyus) varsayimiyla 5 dakika sonrasinin UP olma olasiligina ceviriyoruz, bu theoretical probability'yi
            Polymarket'teki gercek fiyatla (midpoint) karsilastiriyoruz.
        </p>

        <h3 class="docs-subtitle-h3">Algoritma Akisi (3 Katman)</h3>
        <ul class="docs-list">
            <li><strong>Layer 1 — Binance Implied Probability:</strong> Son 60 adet 1-dakikalik log return'den realized volatility (&sigma;) hesaplanir. S<sub>0</sub> (pencere acilis fiyati) ve S<sub>t</sub> (T+2s su anki fiyat) Brownian motion formulune girilir, &Phi;(z) ile UP olasiligi bulunur.</li>
            <li><strong>Layer 2 — Polymarket Midpoint:</strong> Polymarket CLOB'dan UP tokeninin (best bid + best ask) / 2 fiyati okunur. Bu market'in mevcut "inandigi" UP olasiligidir.</li>
            <li><strong>Layer 3 — Arbitrage Karari:</strong> edge = impliedProbUp - polyMidUp. |edge| &lt; 0.03 ise skip (fee yiyecek). edge &gt; 0.03 ise UP underpriced, UP al. edge &lt; -0.03 ise DOWN underpriced, DOWN al.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="docs-subtitle-h3">Kaldirilan Tum Eski Bilesenler</h3>
        <p>
            OFI Delta, OBI, OBI Momentum, VWAP Z-Score, BTC Lead-Lag, Momentum multi-timeframe, Funding Rate modifier,
            Open Interest change modifier, volatility gate, composite score, confidence mapping. <strong>Hepsi silindi.</strong>
            Algoritma su an sadece Brownian motion + Polymarket midpoint karsilastirmasi.
        </p>

        <h3 class="docs-subtitle-h3">Baslangic Performansi</h3>
        <p>
            Ilk saatte <strong>%62 WR, +$25</strong> (devam ediyor). 8 saatlik sonuc Loop34 raporunda tamamlanacak.
            Beklenen sinyal hacmi 5-10/saat (akademik realist). Benjamin-Cup rapor: 8,894 execution'da %1.5-3 kar/islem, %65+ hit rate.
        </p>
    </div>

    <!-- ================================================================== -->
    <!-- BOLUM 6: Matematiksel Formul -->
    <!-- ================================================================== -->
    <div class="docs-card" style="border-left-color: var(--color-accent-blue);">
        <h2 class="docs-title">6. Matematiksel Formul — Brownian Implied Probability</h2>

        <h3 class="docs-subtitle-h3">Implied Probability Hesabi</h3>
        <pre class="docs-code">z = (ln(S_t / S_0) + 0.5 * sigma^2 * tau) / (sigma * sqrt(tau))
impliedProbUp = Phi(z)   // standart normal CDF</pre>

        <h3 class="docs-subtitle-h3">Degisken Tanimlari</h3>
        <table class="docs-table">
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th>Degisken</th>
                    <th>Tanim</th>
                    <th>Kaynak</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr>
                    <td><code>S_0</code></td>
                    <td>Binance spot fiyati, 5-dakika penceresinin baslangici (T=0)</td>
                    <td>Binance kline stream</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td><code>S_t</code></td>
                    <td>Binance spot fiyati, T+2s (trade karari anindaki fiyat)</td>
                    <td>Binance kline stream</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td><code>tau</code></td>
                    <td>Pencerede kalan sure = 4.967 dakika (5 dk - 2 sn giris gecikmesi)</td>
                    <td>Sabit</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td><code>sigma</code></td>
                    <td>Realized volatility = son 60 adet 1-dakika log return'unun standart sapmasi</td>
                    <td>Binance 1m candle</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td><code>Phi</code></td>
                    <td>Standart normal kumulatif dagilim fonksiyonu (CDF)</td>
                    <td>Matematiksel sabit</td>
                </tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>

        <h3 class="docs-subtitle-h3">Arbitrage Edge Hesabi</h3>
        <pre class="docs-code">edge = impliedProbUp - polymarketMidpointUp

|edge| &lt; 0.03   ->  SKIP (3 cent altinda kar fee'ye gider)
edge &gt; 0.03     ->  BUY UP   (UP tokeni underpriced)
edge &lt; -0.03    ->  BUY DOWN (UP overpriced, DOWN underpriced)</pre>

        <h3 class="docs-subtitle-h3">Ornek Hesap</h3>
        <p>
            BTC pencere basi S<sub>0</sub> = $68,000, simdi S<sub>t</sub> = $68,150, &sigma; = 0.0012 (1dk), &tau; = 4.967dk.
            z ~= (ln(68150/68000) + 0.5*0.0012^2*4.967) / (0.0012*sqrt(4.967)) ~= 0.82.
            &Phi;(0.82) ~= 0.794 -> Binance UP olasiligi %79.4.
            Polymarket UP midpoint = 0.68 (%68). edge = 0.794 - 0.68 = +0.114 (&gt; 0.03) -> BUY UP.
        </p>
    </div>

